{"seq":3,"slug":"database-application","title":"数据库应用开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/programming-fundamentals/database-application","wordCount":972,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据库应用开发\">数据库应用开发</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>数据库是几乎所有软件系统的数据存储核心。高职软件技术专业的数据库课程以 MySQL 关系型数据库为主线，覆盖库表设计、SQL 编写与调优、Java 持久层框架（JDBC/MyBatis）以及 Redis 缓存技术，让学生具备从数据建模到高性能数据访问的完整能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"mysql-数据库设计\">MySQL 数据库设计</h3><p>良好的库表设计从需求分析开始，经过概念模型（ER 图）到逻辑模型（范式化）再到物理模型（建表语句）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 订单系统核心表设计&#10;CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,&#10;    user_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;    total_amount DECIMAL(10, 2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0.00,&#10;    status TINYINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 COMMENT &#39;0待付款 1已付款 2已发货 3已完成&#39;,&#10;    created_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;    INDEX idx_user_id (user_id),&#10;    INDEX idx_status_created (status, created_at)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 订单系统核心表设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COMMENT </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0待付款 1已付款 2已发货 3已完成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_user_id (user_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_status_created (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CHARSET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">utf8mb4;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三大范式指导表结构规范化：第一范式要求字段原子性，第二范式消除部分依赖，第三范式消除传递依赖。实际项目中常在第三范式基础上适度反范式化以提升查询性能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sql-优化\">SQL 优化</h3><p>SQL 性能调优的核心工具是 <code>EXPLAIN</code>，它揭示了查询执行计划：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"EXPLAIN SELECT o.id, u.name, o.total_amount&#10;FROM orders o&#10;JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.id&#10;WHERE o.status = 1 AND o.created_at &gt; &#39;2026-01-01&#39;&#10;ORDER BY o.created_at DESC&#10;LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键优化策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>索引覆盖</td>\n<td>查询字段全部在索引中</td>\n<td>避免回表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最左前缀</td>\n<td>复合索引按声明顺序匹配</td>\n<td>索引生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免 SELECT *</td>\n<td>只查需要的列</td>\n<td>减少 IO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分页优化</td>\n<td>用 <code>WHERE id &gt; last_id</code> 替代 <code>OFFSET</code></td>\n<td>深分页不退化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>慢查询日志（<code>slow_query_log</code>）配合 <code>pt-query-digest</code> 可定位线上性能瓶颈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"jdbc-与-mybatis\">JDBC 与 MyBatis</h3><p>JDBC 是 Java 访问数据库的标准 API，MyBatis 在其上提供了 SQL 映射和对象关系映射能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// MyBatis Mapper 接口&#10;@Mapper&#10;public interface OrderMapper {&#10;&#10;    @Select(&quot;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = #{userId} AND status = #{status}&quot;)&#10;    List&lt;Order&gt; findByUserAndStatus(@Param(&quot;userId&quot;) Long userId,&#10;                                     @Param(&quot;status&quot;) Integer status);&#10;&#10;    @Insert(&quot;INSERT INTO orders(user_id, total_amount, status) VALUES(#{userId}, #{totalAmount}, #{status})&quot;)&#10;    @Options(useGeneratedKeys = true, keyProperty = &quot;id&quot;)&#10;    int insert(Order order);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// MyBatis Mapper 接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Mapper</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderMapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = #{userId} AND status = #{status}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByUserAndStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"userId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) Long </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                     @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Param</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) Integer </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INSERT INTO orders(user_id, total_amount, status) VALUES(#{userId}, #{totalAmount}, #{status})\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">useGeneratedKeys</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">keyProperty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Order </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MyBatis 的动态 SQL（<code>&lt;if&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;foreach&gt;</code>、<code>&lt;choose&gt;</code>）解决了复杂查询的 SQL 拼接问题，避免了字符串拼接带来的 SQL 注入风险。</p>\n<p>MyBatis-Plus 进一步简化了单表 CRUD，通过条件构造器实现零 SQL 编码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"List&lt;Order&gt; orders = orderMapper.selectList(&#10;    new LambdaQueryWrapper&lt;Order&gt;()&#10;        .eq(Order::getStatus, 1)&#10;        .gt(Order::getCreatedAt, LocalDateTime.of(2026, 1, 1, 0, 0))&#10;        .orderByDesc(Order::getCreatedAt)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderMapper.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">selectList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LambdaQueryWrapper&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getStatus, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getCreatedAt, LocalDateTime.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2026</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orderByDesc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getCreatedAt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"redis-缓存技术\">Redis 缓存技术</h3><p>Redis 作为内存数据库，读写性能达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> QPS 级别，常用于缓存热点数据、会话存储和分布式锁：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Service&#10;public class UserService {&#10;    @Autowired&#10;    private StringRedisTemplate redisTemplate;&#10;&#10;    public User getUserById(Long id) {&#10;        String key = &quot;user:&quot; + id;&#10;        String cached = redisTemplate.opsForValue().get(key);&#10;        if (cached != null) {&#10;            return JSON.parseObject(cached, User.class);&#10;        }&#10;        User user = userMapper.selectById(id);&#10;        if (user != null) {&#10;            redisTemplate.opsForValue().set(key, JSON.toJSONString(user),&#10;                Duration.ofMinutes(30));&#10;        }&#10;        return user;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Autowired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StringRedisTemplate redisTemplate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUserById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Long </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        String key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"user:\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        String cached </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redisTemplate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opsForValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cached </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> JSON.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parseObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cached, User.class);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        User user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userMapper.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">selectById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            redisTemplate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opsForValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, JSON.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toJSONString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>缓存三大问题及应对：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>缓存穿透</strong>：查询不存在的数据 → 布隆过滤器或缓存空值</li>\n<li><strong>缓存击穿</strong>：热点 key 过期 → 互斥锁或逻辑过期</li>\n<li><strong>缓存雪崩</strong>：大量 key 同时过期 → 过期时间加随机偏移</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>MySQL 9.x 与 HeatWave</strong>：Oracle 推出的 HeatWave 引擎让 MySQL 在不导出数据的情况下执行实时分析查询，OLTP + OLAP 一体化趋势明显</li>\n<li><strong>分布式数据库普及</strong>：TiDB、OceanBase 在国内企业广泛落地，兼容 MySQL 协议但支持水平扩展，高职学生了解分布式概念有利于职业发展</li>\n<li><strong>AI 辅助 SQL 优化</strong>：2026 年 ChatGPT/Copilot 可直接分析慢查询并建议索引策略，但理解 EXPLAIN 输出仍是 DBA 和后端开发者的核心能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个博客系统的数据库表结构（用户、文章、评论、标签），要求满足第三范式，并设计合适的索引支撑&quot;按标签查文章&quot;和&quot;按时间倒序分页&quot;两种查询场景。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>编写一段 MyBatis 动态 SQL，实现&quot;多条件组合查询订单&quot;功能：可选条件包括用户 ID、订单状态、金额范围、时间范围，任意组合均需正常工作。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>实现一个带有 Redis 缓存的用户查询服务，要求：a) 缓存命中直接返回；b) 缓存未命中查数据库并写缓存；c) 用户信息更新时主动删除缓存（Cache Aside 模式）。编写测试验证缓存一致性。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据库应用开发贯穿软件系统的整个生命周期：设计阶段通过 ER 建模和范式化保证数据完整性；开发阶段通过 MyBatis 等框架高效操作数据；运行阶段通过 SQL 优化和 Redis 缓存保障系统性能。从单表 CRUD 到缓存策略，数据层能力的深度直接决定了应用系统的上限。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据库应用开发","id":"数据库应用开发"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"MySQL 数据库设计","id":"mysql-数据库设计"},{"level":3,"text":"SQL 优化","id":"sql-优化"},{"level":3,"text":"JDBC 与 MyBatis","id":"jdbc-与-mybatis"},{"level":3,"text":"Redis 缓存技术","id":"redis-缓存技术"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据结构与算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/programming-fundamentals/data-structures-algorithms"},"next":{"title":"前端开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/frontend-development"}}